{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Sunset Drive</i> is a narrative road trip game about two people, one car, and the time you share before the day fades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s a gentle, intimate journey shaped by conversation, small choices, and quiet detours. You\u2019ll sit with silence, speak when it matters, and maybe uncover things that were left unsaid for too long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s a story about slowing down and noticing the little things. Glances, memories, missed turns that stay with us more than we realize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the trip ends, you can look back on where you\u2019ve been or take the drive again, and see where a different path might lead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Supports English and Japanese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Talk. Stop. Discover. The road is yours.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3609990?t=1745003545","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609990/463226ac4a1d8539699e1827f745ab572f44057e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745003545","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609990/cacf8acad51715bcfeeb3fee25f4b535c4b28b76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745003545","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609990/cacf8acad51715bcfeeb3fee25f4b535c4b28b76/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745003545","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609990/extras/section_banner.png?t=1745003545\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take <i>Sunset Drive</i> with you beyond the screen. In addition to the base game, you will also get the high-resolution, print-ready artworks and full-length soundtracks designed to bring the game\u2019s calm, reflective atmosphere into your everyday life.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Sunset Drive</i> is a narrative road trip game about two people, one car, and the time you share before the day fades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s a gentle, intimate journey shaped by conversation, small choices, and quiet detours. You\u2019ll sit with silence, speak when it matters, and maybe uncover things that were left unsaid for too long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s a story about slowing down and noticing the little things. Glances, memories, missed turns that stay with us more than we realize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the trip ends, you can look back on where you\u2019ve been or take the drive again, and see where a different path might lead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Supports English and Japanese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Talk. Stop. Discover. The road is yours.</strong></p>","developers":["Klapanom Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609990/3693f47528e777337d88c5edde71f9995f218a53/header.jpg?t=1745003545","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Klapanom Games","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recomm